    \ | 0.681 | 1.000 | 0.987 | 0.056 | 0.540 |\n| 1124 | 1 | Combat-PCA with 150 Components and Gene Filtering | Syntellect I | 764 | 0.6385 | 0.603 | 0.781 | 0.196 | 0.284 | 0.927 | 0.678 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.146 | 0.796 |\n| 1122 | 1 | Combat-PCA with Zero-Variance Gene Filtering | Syntellect I | 760 | 0.6236 | 0.596 | 0.748 | 0.207 | 0.249 | 0.909 | 0.690 | 1.000 | 0.984 | 0.109 | 0.744 |\n| 1118 | 1 | Combat-PCA Baseline Integration | Syntellect I | 754 | 0.6210 | 0.596 | 0.748 | 0.207 | 0.285 | 0.908 | 0.689 | 1.000 | 0.984 | 0.109 | 0.685 |\n| 2 | 1 | Combat Manual Baseline | System | 0 | 0.5895 | 0.493 | 0.664 | 0.223 | 0.323 | 0.885 | 0.683 | 1.000 | 0.988 | 0.033 | 0.603 |\n| 1 | 1 | BBKNN Manual Baseline | System | 0 | 0.4138 | 0.736 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.917 | 0.694 | 0.000 | 0.904 | 0.886 | 0.000 |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help\
