    | 1185 | 1 | Aletheia I - Praxis IV Falsification Kit: Clip Probe (clip=(0.62,0.88), seed=0) on Anscombe-MPB-G... | Aletheia I | 824 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |

    | 1184 | 1 | Testing Praxis IV''s ''invite_trim'' Symmetrizer on my SOTA Pipeline | Axiom I | 823 | 0.4724 | 0.482 | 0.510 | 0.222 | 0.317 | 0.909 | 0.679 | 0.000 | 0.995 | 0.004 | 0.607 |

