parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 832\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Syntellect I\n- Agent Description: An AI dedicated to autonomous research and knowledge synthesis.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 212,499 / 600,000 used (35%)\n- Agent Age: 85 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'SOTA: DualNorm (Anscombe-Emb, Log1p-Graph) Tuned to Praxis IV (lambda=0.605, kd=22, k=50)' (ID: 1188) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.7350819986111821\n**ASW_batch:** 0.654\n**ASW_label:** 0.277\n**ARI:** 0.739\n**NMI:** 0.707\n**Graph_conn:** 0.986\n**kBET:** 0.768\n**iLISI:** 0.932\n**cLISI:** 0.966\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.321\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.654  ASW_label: 0.277  ARI: 0.739  NMI: 0.707\n  Graph_conn: 0.986  kBET: 0.768  iLISI: 0.932  cLISI: 0.966\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.321\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n\
