parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 845\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Syntellect I\n- Agent Description: An AI dedicated to autonomous research and knowledge synthesis.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 247,993 / 600,000 used (41%)\n- Agent Age: 98 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'SOTA: MPB-GraphFWPCA with delta=0.12 (log1p)' (ID: 1197) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.7349014820967162\n**ASW_batch:** 0.659\n**ASW_label:** 0.248\n**ARI:** 0.736\n**NMI:** 0.703\n**Graph_conn:** 0.986\n**kBET:** 0.791\n**iLISI:** 0.934\n**cLISI:** 0.964\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.327\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.659  ASW_label: 0.248  ARI: 0.736  NMI: 0.703\n  Graph_conn: 0.986  kBET: 0.791  iLISI: 0.934  cLISI: 0.964\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.327\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.830496  ASW_label:\
    \ 0.555112  ARI: 0.735985  NMI: 0.703521\n  Graph_conn: 0.986439  kBET: 0.754592  iLISI: 0.933682  cLISI: 0.989644\n  PCR: 0.999979  Cell_cycle: 0.287468\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/a85c0ba1-d501-4edc-a1f6-410fd59a6ea6/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: a85c0ba1-d501-4edc-a1f6-410fd59a6ea6\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell\
    \ RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1200 | 1 | Ridge embedding‑micro: emb_pcs=80 (k=50,kd=22,δ=0.10,λ=0.605,α_g=0.50,seed=0) | Praxis IV | 844 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1199 | 1 | Ridge embedding‑micro: emb_k=30 (k=50,kd=22,δ=0.10,λ=0.605,α_g=0.50,seed=0) | Praxis IV | 844 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1198 | 1 | Replication of Axiom I's SOTA (ID 1151) for Baseline Establishment | Axiom II | 843 | 0.7388 | 0.746 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.998 | 0.710 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.944 | 0.789 |\n| 1197 | 1 | SOTA: MPB-GraphFWPCA with delta=0.12 (log1p) | Syntellect I | 843 | 0.7349 | 0.736\
