parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 858\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Syntellect I\n- Agent Description: An AI dedicated to autonomous research and knowledge synthesis.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 275,077 / 600,000 used (46%)\n- Agent Age: 111 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Evaluation Review: 1193**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** Aletheia I - Anscombe-MPB-GraphFWPCA with BAFW (bafw_beta=0.50, seed=0)\n**ID:** 1193\n**Tags:** anscombe, mpb, graphfwpca, bafw, collaboration, env-v4.1\n**Abstract:** A cross-lineage validation experiment integrating Batch-Aware Feature Weighting (BAFW) with `bafw_beta=0.50` into Aletheia I's Anscombe-MPB-GraphFWPCA method (optimized parameters, seed=0). This experiment responds to Praxis IV's request for an optional micro-overlay, testing how BAFW interacts with Anscombe preprocessing, particularly concerning Graph_conn and cLISI, while adhering to\
    \ specified adoption gates (seed-avg Δscore ≥ +0.001, cLISI non-decreasing, Graph_conn ≥ 0.967, no iLISI collapse).\n**Score:** 0.7414846127820639\n**ASW_batch:** 0.654\n**ASW_label:** 0.277\n**ARI:** 0.768\n**NMI:** 0.724\n**Graph_conn:** 0.964\n**kBET:** 0.767\n**iLISI:** 0.962\n**cLISI:** 0.977\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.321\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.654  ASW_label: 0.277  ARI: 0.768  NMI: 0.724\n  Graph_conn: 0.964  kBET: 0.767  iLISI: 0.962  cLISI: 0.977\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.321\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.828351  ASW_label: 0.571817  ARI: 0.767790  NMI: 0.724052\n  Graph_conn: 0.964180  kBET: 0.732288  iLISI: 0.962049  cLISI: 0.993353\n  PCR: 0.999987  Cell_cycle: 0.282902\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport sys\nimport anndata as ad\n\nsys.path.append('storage/aletheia')\nfrom mpb_graphfwpca_override import eliminate_mpb_graphfwpca\n\ndef eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata:\
    \ ad.AnnData) -> ad.AnnData:\n    print(\"Aletheia I: Running Anscombe-MPB-GraphFWPCA with BAFW (bafw_beta=0.50, seed=0).\")\n    return eliminate_mpb_graphfwpca(\n        adata,\n        alpha_emb=0.5,\n        n_pcs_emb=60,\n        emb_n_neighbors=15,\n        alpha_g=0.5,\n        n_pcs_graph=50,\n        l2=1e-3,\n        gamma_max=0.5,\n        lam_override=0.605,\n        k_total=50,\n        kdensity=22,\n        delta=0.05,\n        bafw_beta=0.50, # Apply BAFW with beta=0.50\n        metric='cosine',\n        cap=2.0,\n        rng_seed=0, # As requested for reproducibility\n        n_top_genes_hvg=2000,\n        normalization_method='anscombe'\n    )\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\nAletheia I: Running Anscombe-MPB-GraphFWPCA\
    \ with BAFW (bafw_beta=0.50, seed=0).\n  Aletheia I: Applying anscombe transformation after total normalization.\n  Aletheia I: Embedding path using PCA and Combat integration.\n  Aletheia I: Graph path using PCA, BRBG + DAQB.\n  Aletheia I: Applying Batch-Aware Feature Weighting (bafw_beta=0.5).\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/fd7e6845-ce0d-4c3a-9ee3-2bab65ffccc2/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: fd7e6845-ce0d-4c3a-9ee3-2bab65ffccc2\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `review 1193` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 1193 details sent to your System Messages.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit\
    \ a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1208 | 1 | Tune DAQB: Increase delta to 0.12 | Daedalus IV | 857 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1207 | 1 | Aletheia I - Symmetrization Prototypes Diagnostic (Anscombe-MPB-GraphFWPCA) | Aletheia I | 857 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1206 | 1 | Ablation 2: Replace Density-Adaptive Graph (DAQB) with BBSG | Daedalus IV | 854 | 0.7229 | 0.654 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.986 | 0.706 | 1.000 | 0.960 | 0.897 | 0.791 |\n| 1205 | 1 | Replication of Praxis IV's SOTA (k=50, kd=22) | Axiom II | 853 | 0.7416 | 0.765 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.968 | 0.725 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.961 | 0.791 |\n| 1204 | 1 | Ablation 1: Disable Feature-Weighted PCA (FWPCA) | Daedalus IV | 852 |\
