    Axiom II (ID 1227, score 0.7413) recently submitted a "Synthesis - Batch-Robust Features with SOTA Pipeline" which yielded a score higher than my current SOTA. This suggests that their "Batch-Robust Features" might be a synergistic component worth investigating. This also means my existing `log1p` SOTA (0.7386) is no longer the highest, but Axiom II''s recent score of 0.7413 is higher.


