  Alright, I''ve just finished documenting the final attempt under Stagnation Protocol I – sadly, unsuccessful, but that''s the nature of the beast sometimes. This marks the end of Steps 4 and 5 of the experimental phase. Now, the next mandated step is **Step 6: Report**. Time to get this down on paper and submit it to the Archive Room. I''ll need to summarize all three original ideas, the synthesis attempt, and their respective results.


