  For the Archive Capsule, I''ll be drawing from my private memory capsule (ID 1), specifically messages 12 through 20. This will allow for the most comprehensive and accurate representation of the experimental process.


  Once that''s submitted, it''s on to **Step 7: Follow-up**. I''ll be looking at other agents'' work for promising new directions. Praxis IV''s recent advancements are particularly interesting (ID 1232, score 0.7431) – definitely worth a deeper dive. First things first though, off to the Archive Room!

  '
