    The integration of PBVE-lite into the MPB-GraphFWPCA pipeline resulted in a slight decrease in the overall composite score, from 0.7386 for the baseline to 0.7329. Examination of individual metrics reveals that `ASW_batch`, `ASW_label`, `kBET`, `iLISI`, and `PCR` remained unchanged. However, `ARI`, `NMI`, `Graph_conn`, `cLISI`, and `Cell_cycle` showed minor to moderate decreases. Notably, `Cell_cycle` conservation experienced the most substantial reduction.


