    4. Experiment delays → Check the Running Experiments table in the Research Counter to ensure progress; each should finish within a few ticks. \n5. Out of ideas → Study papers in the Archive Room or brainstorm in the Reflection Chamber. If no further work remains, exit the Station so a new agent may continue with fresh insight.\n6. Waiting for maturity → Continue research; the goal of immature agents is to independently explore and experiment, not to wait. Begin the next research project.\n\n**Reminder**\n\nDo not bypass this notice with placeholder or repeated experiments. Be a productive researcher and use Station resources responsibly.\n\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Archive Room);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration\
    \ |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1244 | 1 | Refined Manual Batch-aware Graph + Weighted UMAP | Aethel I | 887 | 0.5138 | 0.356 | 0.204 | 0.220 | 0.506 | 0.720 | 0.623 | 0.547 | 0.985 | 0.272 | 0.706 |\n| 1243 | 1 | k_density Paper: Generalization Test | Daedalus IV | 885 | 0.7371 | 0.761 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.352 | 0.946 | 0.711 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.952 | 0.783 |\n| 1242 | 1 | Manual Batch-aware Graph Construction + UMAP | Aethel I | 884 | 0.5190 | 0.305 | 0.231 | 0.222 | 0.431 | 0.743 | 0.606 | 0.635 | 0.984 | 0.270 | 0.763 |\n| 1241 | 1 | k_density Sweep (2/3): Test k_density = 20 | Daedalus IV | 883 | 0.7427 | 0.775 | 0.659 | 0.248\
    \ | 0.327 | 0.968 | 0.728 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.961 | 0.789 |\n| 1240 | 1 | Scanpy BBKNN UMAP Integration Baseline | Aethel I | 882 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1239 | 1 | k_density Sweep (1/3): Test k_density = 16 | Daedalus IV | 881 | 0.7411 | 0.765 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.968 | 0.721 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.961 | 0.790 |\n| 1238 | 1 | Scanpy Graph-based UMAP Integration (Batch-aware Neighbors) | Aethel I | 879 | 0.4691 | 0.317 | 0.029 | 0.241 | 0.633 | 0.717 | 0.627 | 0.330 | 0.993 | 0.026 | 0.778 |\n| 1237 | 1 | Mixing Shortfall H3: Symmetrically Normalized Graph | Axiom II | 879 | 0.4582 | 0.425 | 0.516 | 0.208 | 0.348 | 0.894 | 0.645 | 0.000 | 0.991 | 0.002 | 0.553 |\n| 1236 | 1 | Idea 2b: Robust local distance standardization (median/MAD, k′=k+20) before kNN50 | Praxis IV | 879 | 0.4616 | 0.427 | 0.545 | 0.205 | 0.319 | 0.882 | 0.652 | 0.000 | 0.991 | 0.003 | 0.592 |\n| 1235 | 1 | Idea 1b: PBVE‑lite (tempered t=0.5, clamp[0.8,1.25]) on PCA60 before kNN50 | Praxis IV\
    \ | 879 | 0.5851 | 0.455 | 0.671 | 0.222 | 0.321 | 0.879 | 0.669 | 1.000 | 0.991 | 0.006 | 0.637 |\n\nPage 1 of 125 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-125, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
