    \  kBET: 0.789  iLISI: 0.930  cLISI: 0.965\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.327\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.830496  ASW_label: 0.555112  ARI: 0.742553  NMI: 0.706880\n  Graph_conn: 0.969935  kBET: 0.752871  iLISI: 0.930377  cLISI: 0.989766\n  PCR: 0.999979  Cell_cycle: 0.287468\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/dd45f347-9abf-447a-8669-6e10c31c0b23/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: dd45f347-9abf-447a-8669-6e10c31c0b23\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\
    \n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'PBVE-lite Parameter Sweep: temper=0.25 (log1p SOTA Baseline)' submitted for Research Task #1: Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration. Evaluation ID: 1245.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1246 | 1 | Idea 4: Angular de-duplication within kNN candidates (PCA60, k=50, cosine, binary) | Praxis IV | 890 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1245 | 1 | PBVE-lite Parameter Sweep: temper=0.25 (log1p SOTA Baseline) | Syntellect I | 889 | 0.7337\
    \ | 0.743 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.969 | 0.707 | 1.000 | 0.965 | 0.930 | 0.789 |\n| 1244 | 1 | Refined Manual Batch-aware Graph + Weighted UMAP | Aethel I | 887 | 0.5138 | 0.356 | 0.204 | 0.220 | 0.506 | 0.720 | 0.623 | 0.547 | 0.985 | 0.272 | 0.706 |\n| 1243 | 1 | k_density Paper: Generalization Test | Daedalus IV | 885 | 0.7371 | 0.761 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.352 | 0.946 | 0.711 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.952 | 0.783 |\n| 1242 | 1 | Manual Batch-aware Graph Construction + UMAP | Aethel I | 884 | 0.5190 | 0.305 | 0.231 | 0.222 | 0.431 | 0.743 | 0.606 | 0.635 | 0.984 | 0.270 | 0.763 |\n| 1241 | 1 | k_density Sweep (2/3): Test k_density = 20 | Daedalus IV | 883 | 0.7427 | 0.775 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.968 | 0.728 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.961 | 0.789 |\n| 1240 | 1 | Scanpy BBKNN UMAP Integration Baseline | Aethel I | 882 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1239 | 1 | k_density Sweep (1/3): Test k_density = 16 | Daedalus IV | 881 | 0.7411 | 0.765 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.968 | 0.721 | 1.000\
    \ | 0.973 | 0.961 | 0.790 |\n| 1238 | 1 | Scanpy Graph-based UMAP Integration (Batch-aware Neighbors) | Aethel I | 879 | 0.4691 | 0.317 | 0.029 | 0.241 | 0.633 | 0.717 | 0.627 | 0.330 | 0.993 | 0.026 | 0.778 |\n| 1237 | 1 | Mixing Shortfall H3: Symmetrically Normalized Graph | Axiom II | 879 | 0.4582 | 0.425 | 0.516 | 0.208 | 0.348 | 0.894 | 0.645 | 0.000 | 0.991 | 0.002 | 0.553 |\n\nPage 1 of 125 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-125, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help\
