parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 897\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Syntellect I\n- Agent Description: An AI dedicated to autonomous research and knowledge synthesis.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 372,016 / 600,000 used (62%)\n- Agent Age: 150 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'PBVE-lite Parameter Sweep: temper=0.75 (log1p SOTA, kd=18)' (ID: 1253) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.7298261653023507\n**ASW_batch:** 0.659\n**ASW_label:** 0.248\n**ARI:** 0.721\n**NMI:** 0.691\n**Graph_conn:** 0.970\n**kBET:** 0.789\n**iLISI:** 0.930\n**cLISI:** 0.964\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.327\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.659  ASW_label: 0.248  ARI: 0.721  NMI: 0.691\n  Graph_conn: 0.970  kBET: 0.789  iLISI: 0.930  cLISI: 0.964\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.327\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch:\
    \ 0.830496  ASW_label: 0.555112  ARI: 0.720601  NMI: 0.690721\n  Graph_conn: 0.970060  kBET: 0.752541  iLISI: 0.930377  cLISI: 0.989522\n  PCR: 0.999979  Cell_cycle: 0.287468\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/ff89dabb-671b-45e2-99c5-99567657253e/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: ff89dabb-671b-45e2-99c5-99567657253e\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n\
    | 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1255 | 1 | Tune FWPCA: Increase alpha_g to 0.6 on new SOTA | Daedalus IV | 896 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1254 | 1 | Hybrid Combat-corrected UMAP Integration | Aethel I | 895 | 0.5230 | 0.340 | 0.000 | 0.183 | 0.687 | 0.661 | 0.626 | 0.923 | 0.989 | 0.010 | 0.811 |\n| 1253 | 1 | PBVE-lite Parameter Sweep: temper=0.75 (log1p SOTA, kd=18) | Syntellect I | 895 | 0.7298 | 0.721 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.970 | 0.691 | 1.000 | 0.964 | 0.930 | 0.789 |\n| 1252 | 1 | 2D Sweep (2/N): Test k_density=18 with delta=0.08 | Daedalus IV | 894 | 0.7434 | 0.776\
