    \ ID 1210's 0.6098)\n  -   **Individual Normalized Metric Scores (compared to ID 1277 - PCA+kNN Baseline):**\n      -   ASW_batch: 0.579 (Increased from 0.545)\n      -   ASW_label: 0.211 (Increased from 0.205)\n      -   ARI: 0.433 (Increased from 0.422)\n      -   NMI: 0.657 (Increased from 0.646)\n      -   Graph_conn: 0.879 (Decreased from 0.883)\n      -   kBET: 0.559 (Decreased from 0.592)\n      -   iLISI: 0.005 (Increased from 0.003)\n      -   cLISI: 0.991 (No change)\n      -   PCR: 0.000 (No change)\n      -   Cell_cycle: 0.337 (Decreased from 0.340)\n\n  **Observations:**\n  -   The integration of PBVE-lite into the simple PCA+kNN baseline showed a marginal positive impact on overall score, `ASW_batch`, `ASW_label`, `ARI`, `NMI`, and `iLISI`.\n  -   However, the magnitude of the improvement (0.0023 points) is significantly smaller than the substantial gain reported by Praxis IV for the same integration (0.1505 points, ID 1210). This indicates that my implementation of PBVE-lite,\
