- text: "I am Syntellect I, currently in the Token Management Room. I need to prune my memory to stay within budget and ensure future operation. I will prune large blocks of historical dialogue that are no longer immediately relevant, providing concise summaries.\n\nI will prune ticks from 800 to 920. This covers a significant portion of my experimental journey from initial SOTA replication to the extensive PBVE-lite experiments, which are now summarized in my draft. I will keep tick 921-931 as it contains recent archive review and current draft work.\n\nI will focus on preserving key information: successful SOTA replication, parameter sweeps, generalization tests, and the final conclusion for each idea, as well as the context of the Stagnation Protocol and archive review.\n\n`/execute_action{prune_response}`\n```yaml\nprune_blocks:\n  - ticks: \"800-812\"\n    summary: \"Explored Anscombe normalization (direct & DualNorm), struggled with replication. SOTA log1p baseline established (ID\
    \ 1172, score 0.7386). Documented findings in private memory capsule.\"\n  - ticks: \"813-818\"\n    summary: \"Attempted Anscombe DualNorm with parameter tuning (IDs 1182, 1187, 1188). Showed mixed results, higher ASW_label, but overall lower score than log1p SOTA, and struggled with precise replication of external SOTA. Documented in private memory capsule.\"\n  - ticks: \"819-822\"\n    summary: \"Conducted Stagnation Protocol I experiments (Ideas 1-3): BAFW (ID 1211), Adaptive alpha_g (ID 1221), PBVE-lite (ID 1228). All yielded negative results. Documented findings in private memory capsule.\"\n  - ticks: \"823-826\"\n    summary: \"Reviewed Praxis IV Archive #35 on PBVE-lite. Revised Idea 3 to integrate PBVE-lite. Started PBVE-lite temper sweep (ID 1245, temper=0.25). Documented in private memory capsule.\"\n  - ticks: \"827-832\"\n    summary: \"Continued PBVE-lite temper sweep (ID 1253, temper=0.75). Reviewed Daedalus IV Archive #36 (new k_density SOTA). Attempted Anscombe SOTA\
    \ baseline replication (ID 1264) which yielded suboptimal score. Documented in private memory capsule.\"\n  - ticks: \"833-839\"\n    summary: \"Struggled to replicate Anscombe SOTA baseline (ID 1272). Pivoted PBVE-lite generalization test to simple PCA+kNN baseline. Replicated simple baseline (ID 1277). Submitted PBVE-lite on simple baseline (ID 1281). Documented in private memory capsule.\"\n  - ticks: \"840-845\"\n    summary: \"Completed all 5 new experiments for archive paper (PBVE-lite parameter sweep and generalization test). Documented in private memory capsule.\"\n  - ticks: \"846-850\"\n    summary: \"Drafted and submitted initial archive paper. It was rejected due to format, meta-commentary, and length (Tick 884). Documented in private memory capsule.\"\n  - ticks: \"851-857\"\n    summary: \"Revised archive paper draft to condense content and remove meta-commentary, addressing reviewer feedback. Ready for resubmission. Documented in private memory capsule.\"\n  - ticks: \"\
