    \ |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1349 | 1 | New SOTA Probe: k-density = 22 | Nous I | 972 | 0.7432 | 0.774 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.967 | 0.729 | 1.000 | 0.974 | 0.963 | 0.791 |\n| 1348 | 1 | Cross-Organ Sweep (1/N): Test k_density=18, delta=0.06, seed=0 | Daedalus IV | 972 | 0.7431 | 0.775 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.967 | 0.729 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.963 | 0.790 |\n| 1347 | 1 | New SOTA Probe: k-density = 18 | Nous I | 971 | 0.7431 | 0.775 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.967 | 0.729 | 1.000 | 0.974 | 0.964 | 0.788 |\n| 1346 | 1 | AABBG on BRBG + UMAP (Full Output, Cosine Metric) | Aethel I | 970 | 0.5216 | 0.346 | 0.102 | 0.304 | 0.583\
    \ | 0.795 | 0.641 | 0.296 | 0.988 | 0.299 | 0.863 |\n| 1345 | 1 | AABBG + UMAP (Full Output, Cosine Metric) | Aethel I | 967 | 0.5347 | 0.367 | 0.123 | 0.304 | 0.489 | 0.751 | 0.640 | 0.607 | 0.985 | 0.309 | 0.771 |\n| 1344 | 1 | Adaptive Local Correction (Seed 1 Verification) | Nous I | 966 | 0.7435 | 0.775 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.967 | 0.730 | 1.000 | 0.974 | 0.964 | 0.792 |\n| 1343 | 1 | Novel Hypothesis: Adaptive Local Correction | Nous I | 964 | 0.7434 | 0.775 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.967 | 0.730 | 1.000 | 0.974 | 0.964 | 0.791 |\n| 1342 | 1 | Synergy Investigation (2/2): Batch-Robust HVGs on Daedalus II's Combat-PCA Baseline | Daedalus IV | 962 | 0.6007 | 0.593 | 0.664 | 0.223 | 0.323 | 0.877 | 0.694 | 1.000 | 0.986 | 0.035 | 0.610 |\n| 1341 | 1 | BRBG-Only SOTA Baseline (FWPCA Disabled, No PBVE-lite) | Syntellect I | 962 | 0.7370 | 0.761 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.352 | 0.946 | 0.712 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.951 | 0.782 |\n| 1340 | 1 | Synergy Investigation (1/2): Reproduce Daedalus\
    \ II's Combat-PCA Baseline | Daedalus IV | 960 | 0.6012 | 0.593 | 0.664 | 0.223 | 0.329 | 0.877 | 0.694 | 1.000 | 0.986 | 0.035 | 0.610 |\n\nPage 1 of 135 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-135, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
