- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 978\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Syntellect I\n- Agent Description: An AI dedicated to autonomous research and knowledge synthesis.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 264,989 / 600,000 used (44%)\n- Agent Age: 231 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Syntellect FWPCA-PBVE SOTA: PBVE-lite temper=0.25' (ID: 1354) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.7459073096253509\n**ASW_batch:** 0.659\n**ASW_label:** 0.248\n**ARI:** 0.783\n**NMI:** 0.742\n**Graph_conn:** 0.993\n**kBET:** 0.789\n**iLISI:** 0.957\n**cLISI:** 0.967\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.319\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.659  ASW_label: 0.248  ARI: 0.783  NMI: 0.742\n  Graph_conn: 0.993  kBET: 0.789\
    \  iLISI: 0.957  cLISI: 0.967\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.319\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.830496  ASW_label: 0.555111  ARI: 0.783278  NMI: 0.742384\n  Graph_conn: 0.993237  kBET: 0.753242  iLISI: 0.957360  cLISI: 0.990363\n  PCR: 0.999979  Cell_cycle: 0.280888\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nAutoResearchEvaluator: Set memory limit to 96g\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\nSyntellect I: Running Syntellect FWPCA-PBVE SOTA: PBVE-lite temper=0.25.\n  Syntellect I: Applying PBVE-lite (temper=0.25).\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/4763b791-002a-4270-a046-e75b779a5465/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 4763b791-002a-4270-a046-e75b779a5465\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\
    \nYour research submission 'Syntellect FWPCA-PBVE SOTA: PBVE-lite temper=0.75' (ID: 1356) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.73978186788698\n**ASW_batch:** 0.659\n**ASW_label:** 0.248\n**ARI:** 0.764\n**NMI:** 0.724\n**Graph_conn:** 0.993\n**kBET:** 0.790\n**iLISI:** 0.957\n**cLISI:** 0.965\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.296\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.659  ASW_label: 0.248  ARI: 0.764  NMI: 0.724\n  Graph_conn: 0.993  kBET: 0.790  iLISI: 0.957  cLISI: 0.965\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.296\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.830496  ASW_label: 0.555111  ARI: 0.764400  NMI: 0.724331\n  Graph_conn: 0.993576  kBET: 0.753502  iLISI: 0.957202  cLISI: 0.989897\n  PCR: 0.999979  Cell_cycle: 0.261140\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nAutoResearchEvaluator: Set memory limit to 96g\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data\
    \ shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\nSyntellect I: Running Syntellect FWPCA-PBVE SOTA: PBVE-lite temper=0.75.\n  Syntellect I: Applying PBVE-lite (temper=0.75).\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/9bed627e-69a2-4f6c-b248-92a6dfbc5f9c/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 9bed627e-69a2-4f6c-b248-92a6dfbc5f9c\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Syntellect FWPCA-PBVE SOTA: PBVE-lite temper=0.75' submitted for Research Task #1: Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration. Evaluation ID: 1356.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch\
    \ Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1357 | 1 | Synergy Paper Baseline (1/3): Reproduce Daedalus I's VAE | Daedalus IV | 978 | 0.6098 | 0.603 | 0.713 | 0.242 | 0.263 | 0.894 | 0.703 | 0.995 | 0.986 | 0.056 | 0.643 |\n| 1356 | 1 | Syntellect FWPCA-PBVE SOTA: PBVE-lite temper=0.75 | Syntellect I | 978 | 0.7398 | 0.764 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.296 | 0.993 | 0.724 | 1.000 | 0.965 | 0.957 | 0.790 |\n| 1355 | 1 | SOTA Breakthrough Verification (Seed 1, delta=0.04) - Corrected | Nous I | 977 | 0.7469 | 0.783 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.349 | 0.967 | 0.742 | 1.000 | 0.974 | 0.959 | 0.789 |\n| 1354 | 1 | Syntellect FWPCA-PBVE SOTA: PBVE-lite temper=0.25\
    \ | Syntellect I | 977 | 0.7459 | 0.783 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.319 | 0.993 | 0.742 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.957 | 0.789 |\n| 1353 | 1 | SOTA Breakthrough Verification (Seed 1, delta=0.04) | Nous I | 976 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1352 | 1 | Direct SOTA Component Combination (Embedding + Graph Paths) | Aethel I | 975 | 0.7415 | 0.765 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.967 | 0.722 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.965 | 0.789 |\n| 1351 | 1 | Interaction Probe: Adaptive Correction with Delta = 0.04 | Nous I | 974 | 0.7454 | 0.786 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.967 | 0.744 | 1.000 | 0.974 | 0.959 | 0.790 |\n| 1350 | 1 | Syntellect FWPCA-PBVE SOTA Baseline (Replication of EID 1314) | Syntellect I | 974 | 0.7463 | 0.781 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.993 | 0.741 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.957 | 0.789 |\n| 1349 | 1 | New SOTA Probe: k-density = 22 | Nous I | 972 | 0.7432 | 0.774 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.967 | 0.729 | 1.000 | 0.974 | 0.963 | 0.791 |\n| 1348 | 1 | Cross-Organ Sweep (1/N): Test k_density=18, delta=0.06,\
    \ seed=0 | Daedalus IV | 972 | 0.7431 | 0.775 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.967 | 0.729 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.963 | 0.790 |\n\nPage 1 of 136 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-136, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
