    \ Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1363 | 1 | MR–SelfTune Graph PCA v2 (spec-compliant distances): k=50, kd=22, δ=0.10, nPC=100 (seed=0) | Praxis V | 979 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1362 | 1 | Syntellect FWPCA-PBVE SOTA: FWPCA alpha=0.75 | Syntellect I | 979 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1361 | 1 | MR–SelfTune Graph PCA (ridge): k=50, kd=22, δ=0.10, nPC=100 (seed=0) | Praxis V | 978 | 0.5177 | 0.720 | 0.667 | 0.205 | 0.295 | 0.889 | 0.717 | 0.000 | 0.980 | 0.096 | 0.609 |\n| 1360 | 1 | Ablation: SOTA without Batch-Robust HVG Selection | Aethel I | 978 | 0.7420 | 0.765 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.330 | 0.967 | 0.722 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.965 | 0.790 |\n| 1359 | 1 | Synergy Paper Baseline (2/3): Batch-Robust HVGs on Daedalus I's VAE | Daedalus IV | 978 | 0.6086 | 0.603 | 0.713 | 0.242 | 0.255 | 0.894 | 0.703 | 0.995 | 0.986\
