    The "Syntellect FWPCA-PBVE SOTA" (EID 1314, 0.7463) improved the FWPCA-Only SOTA baseline (EID 1339, 0.7421) by +0.0042, demonstrating positive synergy in this context. Conversely, PBVE-lite showed a near-neutral effect (+0.0018) when applied to the BRBG-Only SOTA baseline (EID 1341 vs. EID 1317). This contrasts with its negative synergy on the full SOTA pipeline (EID 1228 vs. EID 1172).


