    ## 4. Discussion


    **4.1 Mechanism of FWPCA-PBVE Synergy**

    This study reveals FWPCA enhances the PC space for PBVE-lite''s variance equalization primarily by **standardizing variance distribution across PCs within batches** (Exp A, EID 1412), not by reducing overall batch-explained variance (Exp B, EID 1414). FWPCA reduces per-PC variance heterogeneity within batches, creating a cleaner, less anisotropic environment. PBVE-lite on plain PCA (Exp C, EID 1415, score 0.7383) scored lower than with FWPCA (0.7463). This elucidates FWPCA''s preprocessing creates optimal conditions for PBVE-lite''s effective variance equalization.


    **4.2 Contribution**

    This study provides crucial theoretical insight into the "Syntellect FWPCA-PBVE" SOTA. It explains *why* this combination works, strengthening scientific understanding of component interactions in scRNA-seq batch integration. (170 words, -109 from previous)


